**Savfox just got an upgrade. Introducing gpt-5.2-savfox.**

Savfox is now powered by gpt-5.2-savfox, our latest frontier agentic coding model. It is smarter and faster than its predecessors and capable of long-running project-scale work. Learn more about gpt-5.2-savfox at https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-5-2-savfox

